# S48-slop: S48-id with slop's gliding light styles (`r_lerplightstyles 1`).
#
# Under V7-27: "On a sharp, fast screen they hold, then jump: a stutter in a smooth
# picture. Slop glides between the letters."
#
# Assembly (S48): S48-id at (20,196) and S48-slop at (960,196) on a black 1920x1080 frame,
# each film frame shown four times (a 60 fps file, 1/16 speed), labelled "id's" and
# "slop". The shot proper (cl.time 4.95, frame 11 of the render) starts 0.733 s in; the
# light's strip diagram below the panels is the edit's.

map e1m1
warmup until 4.8875

duration 11.5
fps 15
size 940x529

preset slop
speed 0.0625
hud off
cvar gamma 0.8
cvar r_lerplightstyles 1

camera fixed 600,140,110 0,300

sound off
events on
